        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, mix, softwood, u=40%, at plant
refers to the actual volume of the wood (not bulked);
Synonyms: Abfallholz, Fichte, Spruce; 
UUID: 164f42c5-91e3-38f0-8a54-887917e27141
Mix of the different industrial residual softwood fractions in proportion to their production in Switzerland
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Mix
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: survey 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the mix is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_164f42c5-91e3-38f0-8a54-887917e27141.xml</text>
